error[reserved-name] 3:19-3:25
  (script {:inputs {:match "Int" :none "Int" :script "Int"}} 1)
                    ^^^^^^
  match is the name of a form, so it cannot name an input.
  Fix: :matched
  Help: sx help script

error[reserved-name] 3:32-3:37
  (script {:inputs {:match "Int" :none "Int" :script "Int"}} 1)
                                 ^^^^^
  none is the name of a form, so it cannot name an input.
  Fix: :missing
  Help: sx help script

error[reserved-name] 3:44-3:51
  (script {:inputs {:match "Int" :none "Int" :script "Int"}} 1)
                                             ^^^^^^^
  script is the name of a form, so it cannot name an input.
  Fix: :scripts
